  "content": "\n\n# Сверхплоское измерение\n\nSuperflat Dimension добавляет тип мира «Суперплоский» в качестве отдельного измерения.\n\n![Preview](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8SpfTsnq/images/504704d46f18ce5831b1aa41d3e50b38dab0f95d.png)\n\n## Использование\n\nЧтобы попасть в Сверхплоское измерение, создайте портал с рамой из обсидиана, блоком травы в обоих верхних углах рамы и землёй в обоих нижних углах, как показано ниже:\n\n![Superflat Dimension Portal](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7332a7349f41af41d29264d3bde5a000a7fd706c.png)\n\n## Совместимость\n\n- [Passengers Portal Fix](https://modrinth.com/project/LI0BrUQA)\n- Аддоны для **Create**: [Create: Portal Integration](https://modrinth.com/project/2f4ngcAb)\n\n## Сообщения об ошибках\n\nНовых проблем совместимости или ошибок не сообщалось. Пожалуйста, сообщайте о них на [GitHub](https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-superflatdimension/issues), чтобы они были исправлены.\n\n## Поддержка\n\n🟩 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2\n\n🟩 Поддерживается  \n🟥 Поддержка прекращена  \n🟨 В процессе  \n🟪 Рассматривается  \n\n## Примечание\n\nВы можете свободно использовать мод в сборках, видео, стримах и других медиа. Если вам нравится этот мод, рассмотрите возможность финансовой поддержки, буду очень благодарен.\n\n<br />\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/curseforge_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/oreno\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://saweria.co/mahmudindes\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionfixer\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dimensionlink\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/worldportal\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vanillaworld\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/morecatvariants\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passengersportalfix\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passengers Portal Fix\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/createportalintegration\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-createportalintegration/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/createportalintegration/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Create: Portal Integration\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/y4wxFDPW\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-amplifieddimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/amplifieddimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Amplified Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Fo9Xodfg\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-largebiomesdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/largebiomesdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Large Biomes Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/Y3EdVfom\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-mushroomfieldsdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/mushroomfieldsdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Mushroom Fields Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/ItO3yfpJ\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-beta173dimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/beta173dimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Beta 1.7.3 Dimension\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/HkbFed4W\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-desertdimension/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/desertdimension/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Desert Dimension